  "source": "auto_from_a",
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "F01",
      "text": "精彩龙舟赛 出彩新聊城 | 5月27日-28日，2023中国聊城·江北水城龙舟公开赛在东昌湖金凤广场水域举办",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shiting/zhibo/20230525/36004.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F02",
      "text": "国内一流的滨水生态景区——东昌湖是国家4A级旅游区、山东省重点服务业园区、山东省生态渔业示范园、国家垂钓基地，也是“江北水城•运河古都——生态聊城”城市品牌的核心区域。",
      "source": "http://www.liaocheng.gov.cn/channel_t_156_16533/doc_639482a8f8ab1b326469ea4c.html",
      "basis": "source_text"
    },
    {
      "id": "F10",
      "text": "光岳楼位于聊城古城中心，是中国历史文化名城聊城的象征。",
      "source": "http://wlj.liaocheng.gov.cn/channel_t_296_26904/doc_63949cadaca39563852dcd10.html",
      "basis": "source_text"
    },
    {
      "id": "F16",
      "text": "国庆长假最后一天欢乐拉满 一城盛景是聊城与游客的双向奔赴（郭绍隆 于春晖） #聊城 #中华水上古城 #光岳楼 #国庆长假",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20261008/188928.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F17",
      "text": "清风漾碧波，东昌湖水上多元运动治愈又解压！",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260814/185710.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F18",
      "text": "光岳楼现日照金楼奇观",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260521/180303.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F19",
      "text": "黄昏时分 收船归来 落日下的东昌湖",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260514/177000.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F20",
      "text": "游船如织 景美如画 东昌湖水上观光升温",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260507/172880.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F21",
      "text": "春日打卡新去处！东昌湖风景区樱花山樱花盛开",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260330/158633.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F22",
      "text": "雪落光岳楼 砖瓦皆成诗",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260302/156289.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F23",
      "text": "新春走基层丨水文“哨兵” 守护东昌湖碧水清波",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/shupingshipin/20260206/153795.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F24",
      "text": "聊城五一假期 如约光岳楼鱼灯舞巡游",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20260506/171848.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F25",
      "text": "冰封东昌湖 候鸟舞翩跹",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20260127/152200.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F26",
      "text": "1月3日，在水上古城四条大街共同表演《江北水城，我爱你》《上春山》，每条大街各100人方阵轮番上演。其中舞龙队以龙腾之姿，在光岳楼前上演压轴大戏。",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20260104/149888.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F27",
      "text": "揽一轮明月，品一味团圆！当聊城光岳楼与满月同框有多美！",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20251006/131159.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F28",
      "text": "【风华聊城 非遗新韵】夜游古城 非遗盛宴！登光岳楼听额尔古纳！看聊城把非遗玩成“江湖livehouse”",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20250630/120494.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F29",
      "text": "聊城东昌湖：不止是冠军基地，更是你下一站“慢生活”目的地~",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shipin/hengpinshipin/20250605/117952.html",
      "basis": "article_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "F30",
      "text": "该视频报道2023中国聊城·江北水城龙舟公开赛于5月27日至28日在东昌湖金凤广场水域举办的精彩赛事。",
      "source": "https://www.lcxw.cn/shiting/zhibo/20230525/36004.html",
      "basis": "video_unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "F03",
      "text": "东昌湖水质清澈，景色宜人，适宜水上游乐项目的开发与建设。",
      "source": "http://www.liaocheng.gov.cn/channel_t_156_16533/doc_639482a8f8ab1b326469ea4c.html",
